Package: networkPlot
Title: Enrich and Visualise PCSF Networks Built by networkGen
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Dora", "Schuller", email = "dschuller@pamgene.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Pathway enrichment (via Enrichr) of a prize-collecting
    Steiner-forest network built by networkGen, and the interactive
    visNetwork HTML rendering of it, plus kinase-by-pathway heatmaps.
    The enrichment reference database (Reactome by default) is a pluggable
    post-processing step, and every styling choice for the HTML lives in a
    single theme object.
